      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ReactiveRedisTemplate</code></a> using given <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory</code></a> applying default\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> serialization.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 创建新的 <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ReactiveRedisTemplate</code></a>，并应用默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 序列化。",
