    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String-focused</code></a> extension of <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ReactiveRedisTemplate</code></a>. As most operations against Redis\nare <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> based, this class provides a dedicated arrangement that minimizes configuration of its more\ngeneric <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>template</code></a> especially in terms of the used <a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String-focused</code></a> 扩展了 <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ReactiveRedisTemplate</code></a>。由于针对 Redis 的多数操作均基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>，该类提供了一个专用配置方案，可最大限度地减少对其更通用的 <a href=\"ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>template</code></a> 的配置，特别是在所使用的 <a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext</code></a> 方面。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
